OL,3,GNEWSABumblebee project seeking to help
OL,4,Arare species
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project is under way to try and help
OL,7,Fone of the UK's "most threatened"
OL,8,Fspecies of bumblebee.
OL,10,FThe Bumblebee Conservation Trust is
OL,11,Fleading a #907,000 three-year scheme
OL,12,Falongside the University of Cambridge
OL,13,Fto recover the Moss carder species.
OL,15,FIt said the initiative would focus on
OL,16,Flandscapes across Cornwall's coastal
OL,17,Fgrasslands, dunes and heathland as well
OL,18,Fas grazing marshes and sea walls in
OL,19,FKent and the upland fringe landscape of
OL,20,Fthe North Pennines.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
