OL,3,GNEWSABumblebee project seeking to help
OL,4,Arare species
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring the project, the trust said it
OL,7,Fwould work with landowners to trial
OL,8,F"small-scale habitat interventions" to
OL,9,Fidentify those which work well while
OL,10,Fgaining a better understanding of the
OL,11,Fspecies' behaviour and needs.
